          }
        },
        {
          "id": "intro_md",
          "component": {
            "MarkdownView": {
              "text": {
                "literalString": "These supports are meant to help with **combat-related PTSD symptoms and depression**—especially flashbacks, feeling on edge, low mood, guilt, numbness, and trouble sleeping. They do **not** mean anything is wrong with you; they are ways to help your nervous system and mind recover from carrying war experiences for too long."
              }
