          "component": {
            "MarkdownView": {
              "text": {
                "literalString": "**How it helps:** Depression care can lighten the weight enough that daily life becomes more manageable.\n\n**Why it matters:** Depression can make everything feel flat, heavy, guilty, hopeless, or exhausting. When that lifts even a little, it is easier to sleep, think clearly, connect with people, and use coping tools.\n\n**Useful supports may include:**\n- Regular counseling\n- A simple daily structure: wake time, food, shower, short walk, one task\n- Talking with a doctor about whether medication could help\n- Reducing alcohol or substances if they make mood or flashbacks worse"
